Package: form.tools
Title: Neutral Model-Driven Workbook Tools
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Tony", "Chemit", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "dev@tchemit.fr",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0007-1802-5256", URL = "https://ultreia.io"))
Description: Provides tools for working with Excel workbooks using form
    definitions supplied by 'form.model'. Splits structurally validated workbooks
    by primary and parent keys and populates matching empty templates while
    preserving their styles and supporting workbook parts. Keeps domain
    definitions and reference data separate from workbook operations.
License: LGPL-2.1
URL: https://ultreia-io.github.io/form.tools/,
    https://github.com/ultreia-io/form.tools
BugReports: https://github.com/ultreia-io/form.tools/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: form.model (>= 0.6.2), xml2, zip
Suggests: knitr, readxl, rmarkdown, testthat (>= 3.0.0), withr
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/Needs/coverage: covr, xml2
Config/Needs/website: pkgdown
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
